  <name>Goldcoin</name>
  <summary>Discover the Gold Standard of Digital Currency</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Goldcoin is the first Digital Gold. A super secure value store and cash payment
      system. Fully decentralized and distributed. Fast and Free. It's the Money for a
      New Generation. Nakamoto used the word Gold multiple times in his Bitcoin
      whitepaper to describe the inner workings of his original protocol. We've preserved
      it, improved it, and made it stronger and faster. Goldcoin (GLC) represents economic
      freedom to 8 billion people Worldwide.
    </p>
  </description>
